  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When hanging out by the mirror with friends, sometimes you want something to look at. Perhaps something that will spark a conversation. A list of examples that I think could be great to have can be for VRChat to display news, updates, open betas, player surveys, statistics, top worlds, amazing art, community events, celebrity/player interviews, and amazing user made articles, content, and videos. I think this would be an amazing addition to bring VRChat more united as a community and to make other player contribute to the growing cultural phenomenon of VR.",
